WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.934 --> 00:00:02.002
-We're back with my family.

00:00:02.002 --> 00:00:03.035
One more thing about
the engagement.

00:00:03.035 --> 00:00:07.340
Mom gave you her ring
to propose with.

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:08.408
-Yeah.
-To McKenzie.

00:00:08.408 --> 00:00:10.709
But, Dad,
this had been your mom's ring.

00:00:10.709 --> 00:00:12.078
-It was my mother's ring.

00:00:12.078 --> 00:00:16.549
And when Hillary and I
got married, we were 22.

00:00:16.549 --> 00:00:19.385
I was going to grad school.
She was hoping for a job.

00:00:19.385 --> 00:00:20.720
We had no money.

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:23.522
And I said to my mother,
"Hey, can I have that ring?

00:00:23.522 --> 00:00:25.891
I'm going to get married."
And my mother said,

00:00:25.891 --> 00:00:28.961
"I'll give it to you when
you've been married 10 years."

00:00:28.961 --> 00:00:31.864
And when we were married
10 years, I got it.

00:00:31.864 --> 00:00:33.532
But we didn't have to wait
to give it to Josh.

00:00:33.532 --> 00:00:35.568
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

00:00:35.568 --> 00:00:39.205
-It's very nice that
she had so much faith in Mom.

00:00:39.205 --> 00:00:41.674
-She did.
She said I had really good teeth

00:00:41.674 --> 00:00:43.276
and I had strong bones.

00:00:43.276 --> 00:00:44.710
[ Laughter ]

00:00:44.710 --> 00:00:47.447
-Did she say that
at 22 or at 32?

00:00:47.447 --> 00:00:50.517
She was like, "We got to see
if these bones hold up."

00:00:50.517 --> 00:00:53.419
-She thought if we had to farm
for a living, we'd be okay.

00:00:53.419 --> 00:00:55.755
-Yeah. No. It's very --
-She said she was a strong girl.

00:00:55.755 --> 00:00:57.323
-Well, the Swedish background,
you know.

00:00:57.323 --> 00:00:59.826
-Yeah, but that is
how you describe a horse.

00:00:59.826 --> 00:01:01.461
[ Laughter ]

00:01:01.461 --> 00:01:04.063
A beautiful coat.
-Yeah.

00:01:04.063 --> 00:01:05.732
She had good withers.

